<sp who="#EHUM"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Evchen.</hi></speaker> <p>Gerechter Gott! was &#x017F;oll das denn<lb/>
<fw type="catch" place="bottom">&#x017F;eyn? &#x2014;</fw><lb/>
