<fw type="header" place="top"><milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/><lb/>
</fw> <sp who="#GRN"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">v. Gro&#x0364;ningseck.</hi></speaker> <p>Warum denn nicht, Na&#x0364;rr-<lb/>
