<fw type="header" place="top"><milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/><lb/>
</fw> <sp who="#MHUM"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Magi&#x017F;ter.</hi></speaker> <p>Sie wollen uns al&#x017F;o verlaßen?</p></sp><lb/>
