<pb n="54" facs="#f0056"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/><lb/>
</fw> <sp who="#HAS"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">v. Ha&#x017F;enpoth.</hi></speaker> <p>Der be&#x017F;te und der toll&#x017F;te Kopf<lb/>
