<sp who="#HUM"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Humbrecht</hi></speaker> <p>Sie &#x017F;ind al&#x017F;o der Herr Fiskal?</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#FIS"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Fiskal.</hi></speaker> <p>Der bin ich; &#x2014; ich &#x017F;chickte vorher &#x2014;</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#HUM"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Humbrecht.</hi></speaker> <p>O mein Herr Fiskal! &#x017F;ie verzei-<lb/>
